abstract: >-
  MOSAIC is a lightweight benchmarking toolkit for tabular classification.
  It supports benchmarking workflows based on PCA or UMAP-reduced feature
  matrices, grid-searches SVC, Random Forest and XGBoost classifiers, evaluates
  model configurations with repeated stratified cross-validation, exports
  tabular performance summaries, and supports final model retraining and
  serialization as deployable model artifacts.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - tabular classification
  - model benchmarking
  - cross-validation
  - PCA
  - UMAP
  - SVC
  - random forest
  - XGBoost
  - cheminformatics